nt price embeds expectations far beyond what can be verified. We do not chase.\n\n---\n\n# SECTION 5. CONVICTION & POSITION SIZING\n\n## 5-1. Conviction Score (Total 15)\n\n| Component | Score (0-3) | Rationale |\n|---|---|---|\n| Business quality | 3 | Wide moat, excellent financials, elite capital allocation |\n| Valuation attractiveness | 0 | No margin of safety; 30x forward EPS |\n| Macro alignment | 2 | Neutral-to-supportive (AI capex offsets rate drag) |\n| Thesis clarity (KPIs) | 3 | Bookings, backlog, Applied orders, services growth \u2014 all measurable |\n| Execution traceability | 2 | Beat-and-raise pattern strong, but relies on just 8-10 quarters |\n\n**Conviction Score: 10/15 \u2014 HIGH (but mispriced at T0)**\n\n## 5-2. Conviction Decay\n\n- Without confirming evidence (continued Applied bookings >50% YoY, services >12% growth), conviction decays -1pt per 6 months.\n- Current pricing embeds perfection \u2014 the bar for disappointment is low.\n\n## 5-3. Sizing\n\n| Rule | Outcome |\n|---|---|\n| Max weight at High conviction | 6-8% |\n| **Valuation override (MoS <0%)** | **0% new capital** |\n| Macro cap | N/A (neutral) |\n\n**Actual recommended position: 0% weight at $453. Entry zone: $340-$390 (25-30x FY27 EPS).**\n\n---\n\n# SECTION 5.5. BEHAVIORAL & POSITIONING\n\n| Item | Value | Interpretation |\n|---|---|---|\n| Short % float | 1.91% (4.21M shares, 3.31 DTC) | low; no squeeze risk |\n| Institutional ownership | 91.57% | **Extremely crowded**; passive/ETF flow dependency high |\n| Insider ownership | 0.27% | negligible alignment |\n| Options positioning | [Unconfirmed] \u2014 not in pack | \u2014 |\n| Sentiment extremes | Consensus mean PT $525, low $422 [Actual \u2014 aggregator] | Sell-side is 16% above T0 \u2014 usual bullish skew, but the low PT = $422 is 7% below current \u2192 some analysts see downside |\n| 52-week range | $348.06 \u2013 $505.87 | Stock is 10% off highs |\n| **Crowding Risk Score** | **13/15** | Institutions 92%, momentum